  "body": "Part of #4023. Builds on K0.\n\n## What to do\n\nMake one region model for all strategies.\n\n- Input: a selection (edge, face, chain, or points that straight lines join).\n- Input: the material side (inside or outside of the selection) and the bounds.\n- Output: one region value that each guide curve planner reads.\n- The material side does not depend on the start side.\n- Refuse a degenerate selection with a diagnostic.\n\n## Done means\n\nThe strategies of 2D milling get their region from this one model, and a test pins that one selection gives one region.\n",
